{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284170","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1028417001:1":{"text":"당신들... 또 무슨 일이죠? 지금은 기운이 하나도 없으니까, 사람 찾아달라고 하지 마세요.","source_cn":"又是你们……还有什么事吗？先说好，我真的没力气，别让我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9DB68EA1CA01CBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028417002:1":{"text":"우선 이 약을 먹어보세요. 기력이 좀 회복될 거예요.","source_cn":"请试试这些草药，应该可以让你恢复一些气力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BA76C841B7CBBC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028417003:1":{"text":"병을 치료할 수 있나요? 제발 효과가 있기를...","source_cn":"你们能治疗我们身上的病？弥萨忒保佑，希望有效果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA424F46A4BBAD74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028417004:1":{"text":"맛이 좀 이상한데요...","source_cn":"味道有点怪怪的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16D18A1AEE9FC4ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028417005:1":{"text":"... 몸이 가벼워졌어요. 도끼도 들 수 있을 것 같아요...","source_cn":"……感觉身上轻松了，也能拿动斧子了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF382ED2064E7358A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docum